        <mxCell id="constraint-note" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;fillColor=#fff2cc;fontColor=#666666;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;PARALLEL=1 CONSTRAINT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px;&quot;&gt;Only ONE model can be loaded in GPU at any time.&lt;br&gt;ELP3/ELP2 are deterministic (no GPU).&lt;br&gt;ELP1 and ELP0 share GPU — ELP0 is preempted on ELP1 arrival.&lt;br&gt;Violation = Metal OOM = server crash.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
