        <mxCell id="hw-linux" parent="hw-identity-box" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;fontColor=#666666;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="&lt;b&gt;Linux Hardware Sources&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px;&quot;&gt;• lsusb (USB devices)&lt;br&gt;• lshw -c system (system info)&lt;br&gt;• lspci (PCI devices)&lt;br&gt;• dmidecode -t system (BIOS/Serial)&lt;br&gt;• /proc/cpuinfo (CPU)&lt;br&gt;• dmidecode -t memory (RAM)&lt;br&gt;• lsblk -d -o NAME,SERIAL (disk)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
